# ER calculator per-source intermediate data files.
# Only particles.json (the merged production file) is committed.
# Per-source files are regenerated via:
#   scripts/scrape_particles.py          -> particles.fandom.json
#   scripts/scrape_particles_lunaris.py  -> particles.lunaris.json
#   gcsim-particle-extract agent sweep   -> particles.gcsim.json
# Then merged via scripts/merge_particles_sources.py -> particles.json
src/data/ercalc/particles.fandom.json
src/data/ercalc/particles.gcsim.json
src/data/ercalc/particles.lunaris.json
scripts/out/particles.gcsim.batch_*.json
scripts/out/particle-locations.json